// Regression test for issue #525: SHR after double MOD with address env opcode
// ORIGIN returns a 160-bit address.  Two MOD(0, origin) = 0, so
// SHR(0, origin) = origin >> 0 = origin.
// Bug: multipass JIT leaked a garbage shift count from the second MOD's
// register allocation, causing origin to be incorrectly shifted.
ORIGIN
DUP1
DUP1
PUSH0
MOD
MOD
SHR
PUSH0
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH0
RETURN
